rsity is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Caldwell University offers the following benefits to part-time employees that include: 50% tuition remission Paid sick leave Retirement Savings: 403(b) supplemental retirement annuity plan We are not currently looking for any positions in this department. In this section Employment Opportunities Administration – Executive Administration – Full-Time Office Support Staff Positions Administration – Part-Time Athletics Positions – Full-Time Athletics Positions – Part-Time Faculty Positions – Full-Time Faculty Positions – Adjunct Faculty Positions – Part-Time Equal Employment Opportunities Caldwell University does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national and ethnic origin, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law in administration of its educational policies, admissions policies, scholarship and loan programs, and athletic and other school-administered programs. Academics Degrees & Programs Academic Calendar Summer Session Course Search Undergrad Catalog Graduate Catalog Registrar Community About Caldwell Campus Life Cougar Alumni Helpful Links Cougar One Stop Caldwell University Student Handbook Campus Store Corporate Partnerships Employment Give to Caldwell News Title IX and Anti-Harassment and Discrimination Policy Student Consumer Information Digital Millennium Copyright Act Privacy Policy 120 Bloomfield Avenue, Caldwell, NJ 07006 Map & Directions Contact Us Website Accessibility Request Info Schedule a Visit Caldwell University does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national and ethnic origin, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law in administration of its educational policies, admissions policies, scholarship and loan programs, and athletic and other school-administered programs. ©2026        Caldwell University Privacy Policy Caldwell University is proudly powered by WordPress round-tick-outline round-tick-fill tick double-tick round-cross-outline round-cross-fill cro